 "items": [
  {
   "key": "T",
   "claim_text": "# It Was Supposed to Be an AI Call, but a Human Appeared Behind the Scenes",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C1"
  },
  {
   "key": "S1.3",
   "claim_text": "The AI on your screen does all of it.",
   "routes": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C2"
  },
  {
   "key": "S1.4",
   "claim_text": "It is a very convenient future.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-004"
   ],
   "cid": "C3"
  },
  {
   "key": "S3.1",
   "claim_text": "But something unexpected happened behind the scenes.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C4"
  },
  {
   "key": "S4.1",
   "claim_text": "Muse receives the request.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C5"
  },
  {
   "key": "S4.2",
   "claim_text": "Up to that point, it is AI.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C6"
  },
  {
   "key": "S4.5",
   "claim_text": "It was as if a supporting actor, hard to spot in the script, had appeared in a play starring AI.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C7"
  },
  {
   "key": "S5.2",
   "claim_text": "The fact that humans handled the calls was not, by itself, an immediate problem.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-010"
   ],
   "cid": "C8"
  },
  {
   "key": "S5.3",
   "claim_text": "The bigger problem was that testing began without giving people enough information about this fact.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C9"
  },
  {
   "key": "S7.1",
   "claim_text": "This is an important point.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-010"
   ],
   "cid": "C10"
  },
  {
   "key": "S7.2",
   "claim_text": "There was no confirmation that a large-scale information leak had taken place.",
   "routes": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-010"
   ],
   "cid": "C11"
  },
  {
   "key": "S7.3",
   "claim_text": "But people did not know who was actually handling the work they had asked AI to do.",
   "routes": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C12"
  },
  {
   "key": "S7.5",
   "claim_text": "When that happens, a convenient service suddenly starts to look like a mystery story.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-010"
   ],
   "cid": "C13"
  },
  {
   "key": "S8.1",
   "claim_text": "Meta executives admitted that starting the test without a proper explanation was a mistake.",
   "routes": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C14"
  },
  {
   "key": "S8.2",
   "claim_text": "They also temporarily put back the feature in which humans handled the calls.",
   "routes": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C15"
  },
  {
   "key": "S8.3",
   "claim_text": "They did not stop Muse itself.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C16"
  },
  {
   "key": "S9.1",
   "claim_text": "Going forward, Meta plans to make the feature available only when preparations are complete and it can clearly explain who will make the calls.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-014"
   ],
   "cid": "C17"
  },
  {
   "key": "S10.1",
   "claim_text": "Even in an age when AI does our work, humans may step in to help.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-006"
   ],
   "cid": "C18"
  },
  {
   "key": "S10.2",
   "claim_text": "But when they do, they should not appear secretly.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C19"
  },
  {
   "key": "S10.3",
   "claim_text": "If they step onto the stage, they should say who they are first.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C20"
  },
  {
   "key": "S10.4",
   "claim_text": "This incident showed that simple rule in a very memorable way.",
   "routes": [
    "r3"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-012"
   ],
   "cid": "C21"
  },
  {
   "key": "S7.4",
   "claim_text": "Also, their personal information might reach that person.",
   "routes": [
    "r5"
   ],
   "related": [
    "MUSE-HC-010"
   ],
   "cid": "C22"
  }
 ],
